{"ISBN:9783030071844":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9783030071844","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL28231018M/Living_Mantra","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL28231018M/Living_Mantra","thumbnail_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/10162903-S.jpg","details":{"publishers":["Palgrave Macmillan"],"subtitle":"Mantra, Deity, and Visionary Experience Today","covers":[10162903],"physical_format":"paperback","full_title":"Living Mantra Mantra, Deity, and Visionary Experience Today","key":"/books/OL28231018M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL3229496A","name":"Mani Rao"}],"source_records":["amazon:3030071847","bwb:9783030071844"],"title":"Living Mantra","notes":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Source title: Living Mantra: Mantra, Deity, and Visionary Experience Today (Contemporary Anthropology of Religion)"},"number_of_pages":215,"isbn_13":["9783030071844"],"isbn_10":["3030071847"],"publish_date":"Jan 03, 2019","works":[{"key":"/works/OL20847979W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"lc_classifications":["H1-970.9"],"latest_revision":2,"revision":2,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2020-06-10T14:32:28.615664"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2021-12-26T00:47:42.445330"}}},"ISBN:9783319963907":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9783319963907","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL28226638M/Living_Mantra","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL28226638M/Living_Mantra","thumbnail_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/10158635-S.jpg","details":{"publishers":["Palgrave Macmillan"],"subtitle":"Mantra, Deity, and Visionary Experience Today","covers":[10158635],"physical_format":"hardcover","full_title":"Living Mantra : Mantra, Deity, and Visionary Experience Today","key":"/books/OL28226638M","authors":[{"key":"/authors/OL3229496A","name":"Mani Rao"}],"source_records":["amazon:3319963902","bwb:9783319963907","marc:harvard_bibliographic_metadata/20220215_067.bib.mrc:186228728:3584"],"title":"Living Mantra","notes":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Source title: Living Mantra: Mantra, Deity, and Visionary Experience Today (Contemporary Anthropology of Religion)"},"number_of_pages":215,"isbn_13":["9783319963907"],"isbn_10":["3319963902"],"publish_date":"Sep 16, 2018","works":[{"key":"/works/OL20847979W"}],"type":{"key":"/type/edition"},"lc_classifications":["H1-970.9","BL1236.36 .R35 2018"],"oclc_numbers":["1041502653"],"languages":[{"key":"/languages/eng"}],"description":{"type":"/type/text","value":"Living Mantra is an anthropology of mantra-experience among Hindu-tantric practitioners. In ancient Indian doctrine and legends, mantras perceived by rishis (seers) invoke deities and have transformative powers. Adopting a methodology that combines scholarship and practice, Mani Rao discovers a continuing tradition of visionaries (rishis/seers) and revelations in south India's Andhra-Telangana. Both deeply researched and replete with fascinating narratives, the book reformulates the poetics of mantra-practice as it probes practical questions. Can one know if a vision is real or imagined? Is vision visual? Are deity-visions mediated by culture? If mantras are effective, what is the role of devotion? Are mantras language? Living Mantra interrogates not only theoretical questions, but also those a practitioner would ask: how does one choose a deity, for example, or what might bind one to a guru? Rao breaks fresh ground in redirecting attention to the moments that precede systematization and canon-formation, showing how authoritative sources are formed."},"latest_revision":3,"revision":3,"created":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2020-06-10T01:34:05.304957"},"last_modified":{"type":"/type/datetime","value":"2025-05-19T21:23:41.081517"}}},"ISBN:9780931454059":{"bib_key":"ISBN:9780931454059","info_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL4096107M/Mantras","preview":"noview","preview_url":"http://openlibrary.org/books/OL4096107M/Mantras","thumbnail_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/131797